// Bandit Level 8 → Level 9

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 8 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit8@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 7.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `data.txt` is present.

Step5: We need to find the only line that occurs exactly once in the file.

Step6: Sort the contents of the file and use `uniq` to find the unique line:

        sort data.txt | uniq -u

Step7: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit9`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit9@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 8 → Level 9 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
